   :depth 1,
   :dependencies #{:1-l6a005}},
  :1-l6a008
  {:statement
   "Combining: $H(\\pi') = H(\\pi) + \\sum_{\\omega \\in \\Omega} \\pi(\\omega) \\log_2 k_\\omega$. This is the entropy of the original distribution plus the expected $\\log_2$ of the splitting factors. QED.",
   :taint :clean,
